  "question": {
    "text": "Three charges <math><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></math> are placed respectively, at distance, <math><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></math> and <math><mi>d</mi></math> from the origin, on the <math><mi>x</mi></math> -axis. If the net force experienced by <math><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo></math> placed at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> is zero, then value of <math><mi>q</mi></math> is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"assets\\st0204_f99735297844.png\" /><br /><br />For net force on charge placed at origin is given as&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi>&#160;</mi></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math>&nbsp;is a constant.</p><p>Solving the above equation, we get,&nbsp;<math><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, the charge&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;such that net force on the charge&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;placed at origin is zero.</p></blockquote>"
  }
}